 "title": "Treasurer | Andrew County MO",
 "text": "Treasurer | Andrew County MO\nHome\nOffices ▼ Commissioner\nAssessor\nCircuit Court\nCollector\nCounty Clerk\nProsecuting Attorney\nPublic Administrator\nRecorder of Deeds\nSheriff\nTreasurer\n911 Addressing\nEmergency Mgmt.\nJury\nRoad & Bridge\nAbout Us ▼ History\nCalendar\nCities & Villages\nDirectory\nDirections\nArea Interest\nARPA\nTextMyGov\nFollow\nHome\nOffices\nCommissioner\nCollector\nPublic Administrator\nTreasurer\nJury\nAssessor\nCounty Clerk\nRecorder of Deeds\n911 Addressing\nRoad & Bridge\nCircuit Court\nProsecuting Attorney\nSheriff\nEmergency Mgmt.\nAbout Us\nHistory\nCalendar\nCities & Villages\nDirectory\nDirections\nArea Interest\nARPA\nTextMyGov\nTreasurer\nHome\n/\nOffices\n/\nTreasurer\nCindy Esely\nTreasurer\ntreasurer@andrewcountymo.gov\nCONTACT INFORMATION\nP.O. Box 122\nSavannah, MO 64485\nPhone : 816-324-3614 Ext 7\nFax : 816-324-6154\nLOCATION\nOn the main level of the courthouse.\nServices\nResponsible for issuing receipts for all the revenue that comes into the county.\nMaking the bank deposits.\nInvesting the monies.\nBalancing the bank accounts.\nTracking all the revenue funds.\nKeeping a daily record and balance on each fund (Currently there are 69 funds).\nResponsible for the distribution of school funds generated from fines and monthly distribution of tax revenue to local entities.\nProvide monthly detailed reports to Road & Bridge and Law Enforcement.\nResponsible for payments for NID’s (Neighborhood Improvement Districts).\nManage receipts and disbursements for Emergency Watershed Projects.\nAndrew County Court House\n411 Court St.\nSavannah, MO 64485\nBuilding Hours 8 AM – 4:20 PM**\nOfficial Missouri State Website\nGovernor\nSecretary of State\nMissouri Association of Counties\nNational Association of Counties\nAccessibility Statement\n**Individual offices have differing hours, please check with that office for exact times.",
